{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"211"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香ちゃんは今年のクリスマス。どのように過ごしたんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて地元を離れて東京で過ごしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのみんなにメリクリー!って言えて幸せー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"212"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはいつまでサンタがいると信じてましたか？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"213"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂って どこ？』の司会進行役のバナナマンのお二人はひめたんから見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな印象の方かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっとテレビで拝見してただけに最初は緊張..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したけど、同時に親近感わくわくo(^-^)o♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後日おともだちみんなに自慢させてもらいました。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりオーラが違う!ひめたんももっとキラキラオーラ放たなきゃ★きらーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"214"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手の時思ったけどひめたんはわざと上目使いで話してるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいやそんなことないはずー何でぢゃろ(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん初めましての方のおかお見るとき、恥ずかしくてうつむいちゃうって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クセがあるんですよね多分ー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからかな？気をつけます(`・・)ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとしっかり目あわせよっかなー...(//ω//)きゃは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"215"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはお正月は何するのかな！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが受験に合格するように自分もお参りしますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーんありがとうございます♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもお参りしたいけど、でも親戚のみんなにあいさつもしたいしー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今さらぢゃけど年賀状書いとらんしー←え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"216"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの部屋着可愛いね水玉すきなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かに水玉好きかも∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本かわいければ何でもおっけーって人かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このルームウェアは一目惚れしましたよ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色とかデザインとかお気に入り^^うん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"217"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手く感謝の気持ちを伝える方法とかありますかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんも感謝の気持ちを表に出すのあんま得意な人じゃないですよ('`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えとることとかヒミツ事とかはわかりやすいってよく言われるのにー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素直になるの恥ずかしいんですよね。ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに、たまーに、素直になったらいいのでは？それでも十分伝わりますよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"218"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握力強いなら今度勝負しよ～。オレとか握力85しかないからな（照れ←あ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は、はちじゅうごー!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪キミってーもしかしてもしかーして～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの3.5倍はありますね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わおw(°O°)w!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"219"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5日の当落がもうすぐ出るんだよね。果たしてひめたんに挨拶に行けるのか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応募した方全員来てほしーい(o>ω<o)!\n当たったよーって方は報告待ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"220"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところで、『ドリミネーション』って、ドリーム+イルミネーションの事なの？？？\nDream + Illuminations = Dreamination ？？？かな？？？\n靴の周りは水晶のモチーフなのかな？ららちゃんの馬車、一般の人は乗れるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ドリームあんどイルミネーション。確かにそんな掛詞が隠れてるー!納得。\n◎ひめたんもそうだと思います(^^)くりすたる!\n◎りあるな話、ホームページで予約するとララちゃんの馬車に乗れるんとー。\nひめたんも来年はララちゃんに乗りたーい(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"221"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファミレスなら何処が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おともだちと行くのはサイゼリア\nふぁみりーと行くのはガスト\nメンバーと行くのはジョナサン\n囲みに東日本のジョナサン＝西日本のジョイフルなんだってー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"222"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山口県も近いしふぐとかも食べるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがおとなりの県の名産品って普段あんまり食べる機会ないですよっ\nふぐ食べたことないしー('`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"223"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはプレッシャーには弱いのかな?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレッシャー...うん弱い。弱いです。\n不安やら緊張やらはひめたんのお腹を刺激します('・ω・`)\nいや始まってしまえば楽なんですけどね。慣れるまでが長くてー...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"224"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、運動苦手なんだ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃは(ω)バレちゃった♪♪\n走る、飛ぶ、投げる、泳ぐ、何にもできません。てへぺろ。\nただしリズム感はあるみたいで、大縄跳びなんかは引っ掛かからんよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"225"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは学校でどんなキャラですか？？部活の後輩に怒ったりしますか？\n僕は学校で後輩に注意できなくて困っています＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校でもわりとこんな感じだと思いますよー。\nひとりだけおかしい子みたいになっとるんかなーって心配になりますか？←\nそれが、ひめたんの周りはみーんなおんなじノリだから全然浮いてないです♪\nさすが中坊ーわら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後輩には結構怒る人(∀)\nだって放送部元部長さんですよひめたん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも注意するのって難しいですよね。\n信頼関係が出来上がってないと年上に耳を貸さないと思うし...。\nあー、もちろん怒るのも大事ぢゃけど、\n悪いとこ直ったらちゃんと認めることも大事だと思います(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"226"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"社会が好きということなので…ひめたんは歴史で好きな時代とかありますか(・_・?)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、戦はあんま好きくないです('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"国風文化とかある平安時代が平和で好きすき(∀)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暗記物は得意ぢゃけど、時代劇は怖くて見れないー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"227"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのカラオケ18番は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪へび～ろ～て～しょ～～～ん^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"228"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月広島で過ごすん？？乃木坂のメンバーと遊ぶん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが、今年は東京で年越しってことになりました(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年始から入っとるレッスンはお休みしたくないなーと思って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと遊ぶ...はいノープランです。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"229"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5日のイベントハズレちゃったんだけど。次はいつひめたんに会えるんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会えなすぎて病気になっちゃうんんだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたらいいかな？対処方法を教えてよ～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほえーいつになるんぢゃろ('`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんに会いたい病はひめたんに会わないと治らんよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぢゃお薬として、毎日ブログ遊びに来てくださーい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこでお話ししましょうよ★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"病状悪化するかな('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"230"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはチャレンジしてみたい髪型とかあるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっアリスになってみたいー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"231"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、広島弁無理して使ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通でいいのに(ToT)ちょっと不自然なような…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全っ然無理してないですよー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、文字にしちゃうとちょっと読みにくいかなーと最近思ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"232"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかし、よくメンバーの家に泊まりに行くなー！さすがは甘えん坊ひめたん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何？ホテルじゃつまらないからつい泊まりに行っちゃうの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーさすがに毎日遊びに行くのは申し訳ないだろうなーと思いつつ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが誘ってくれるし、楽しいぢゃあないですか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"233"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんコーデっていうのはせいたんの服？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんが選んだコーデっていうのは？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんの服!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でさらに、せいたんがコーディネートした組み合わせってことです(∀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"234"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめにょん…野球好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ルールわかんない('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも野球少年はかっこいいと思います♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"235"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめにょんいいよね（＾o＾）/ニックネーム変えちゃえば？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にょーん(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめにょん好きぢゃけど、ひめたんも好きなんよねー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。その日の気分で決めよ。そうしよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"236"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、何人のメンバーの家に泊まりましたか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泊まったメンバーの家に、何かマーキングしていますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４？４人で合ってますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。2012年の目標は「メンバー全員のお家を制覇する」!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...やっぱり、2020年くらいまでかかりそう(>_<)宣言するのはやめときます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マーキング。わんちゃんみたいですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"237"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはちょっとあごを引いて前を見るクセがあるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意識したことはないですー...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからクセなんかぁ(^^)わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"238"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだやった『ご当地アイドルNo.1決定戦』を優勝した『まなみのりさ』って先輩？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喋ったり一緒にステージに上がった事ってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩ですー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスやらバレンタインやら、一緒にステージで歌わせていただきました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユニット組んでいただいたこともありましたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなみのりささんは常に意識が高くて、本当にいろんなこと教わりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今でも尊敬してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"239"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはお年玉もらったら何に使おうかもう決めてるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"or今までお年玉で買ったものはなーにー？(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は決まってないですー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までは福袋買ったり、ちっちゃい時はおもちゃ買ったり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"８割は貯金(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"240"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ俺はひめたんにキュンキュンだからひめきゅんって呼ぼうかな？どう？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃは(*/ω＼*)採用しちゃおっかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃあ、「ひめたんにキュンキュンしてる人」＝ひめきゅん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんふぁんのみなさんのことをひめきゅんって呼んぢゃおっかなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう。あなたのことです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/28/3.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}